{"title":"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A group of children riding on bicycles and tricycles rode past Billy Bob's house. Billy Bob counted <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> children and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> wheels. How many tricycles were there?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb832792165b5869b5f555cffa014c5d1091819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If all the children were riding bicycles, there would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe13e3e32145343b1a7838fc6466d87d04348f7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 7=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" /> wheels. Each tricycle adds an extra wheel and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5df9723324a8a35a9e853115a3f48f764ed2f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19-14=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> extra wheels are needed, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/478bc8af65d1b320b4fec0fd344399c18be36127.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"29\" /> tricycles.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Setting up an equation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e60b48417be5d388b9a7cff06a7255b852cc930f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> children and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecdbbafbb256da55faf99d1ad9d494dad94dfd3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+2b=19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />. Solving for the variables, we get, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/b/7db6560d402ff8010b7b1ec2c61fe2df00d13d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"87\" height=\"29\" /> tricycles.\n</p><p>~AllezW\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 8\">2003 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center